# Render: cd docs/demo && vhs demo.tape
Output demo.gif
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 960
Set Height 560
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Hide
Type "alias /kickstart='bash ./demo.sh'; alias 2='bash ./apply.sh'; PROMPT='%F{cyan}❯%f '; clear"
Enter
Show

Sleep 800ms
Type "/kickstart"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 9s
Type "2"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 4.5s
